meta {
  name: Upload documents
  type: http
  seq: 10
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/users/me/files
  body: multipartForm
  auth: none
}

body:multipart-form {
  govCard: @file()
  experienceForm: @file()
  photo: @file()
}

docs {
  User login (cookie Authentication_User): run "User auth / Login" first. Approved users only (otherwise 403 user not validated), and only while the request status is 3 (otherwise 403 "documents can be uploaded only at request status 3"). Moves the user to status 4. `govCard` and `experienceForm` are PDFs of at most 10 MB, each required unless the user already has one (400 "govcard is required" / "expfile is required"). `photo` is an optional JPG or PNG that replaces the current photo.
}
